{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"b1-grammar-n-deklination","level":"B1","topic":"Nomen","title":{"de":"Die n-Deklination","bn":"N-declension: কিছু masculine noun-এর ending বদলায়"},"summary":"der Student → den Studenten, der Junge → dem Jungen।","intro":[{"kind":"text","text":"Topic 11-এ মূলত তিনটি জিনিস শিখবে: N-declension, noun-verb combinations এবং compound nouns।"}],"sections":[{"heading":"N-declension","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"কিছু masculine noun Akkusativ ও Dativ-এর মতো নির্দিষ্ট case-এ -n বা -en নেয়।"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Der Student lernt Deutsch.","en":"The student learns German.","bn":"ছাত্রটি জার্মান শেখে।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"এখানে der Student হলো Nominativ।"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich sehe den Studenten.","en":"I see the student.","bn":"আমি ছাত্রটিকে দেখি।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"এখানে den Studenten হলো Akkusativ।"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich helfe dem Jungen.","en":"I help the boy.","bn":"আমি ছেলেটিকে সাহায্য করি।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"der Junge → dem Jungen।"},{"kind":"text","text":"এ ধরনের noun-এর কয়েকটি উদাহরণ: der Student, der Junge, der Kollege, der Mensch।"}]},{"heading":"আরও উদাহরণ","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"আরও কয়েকটি n-Deklination noun: der Nachbar, der Patient, der Herr।"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich frage den Kollegen.","en":"I ask the colleague.","bn":"আমি সহকর্মীকে জিজ্ঞেস করি।"},{"de":"Wir sprechen mit dem Nachbarn.","en":"We are talking to the neighbour.","bn":"আমরা প্রতিবেশীর সঙ্গে কথা বলছি।"},{"de":"Der Arzt hilft dem Patienten.","en":"The doctor helps the patient.","bn":"ডাক্তার রোগীকে সাহায্য করেন।"},{"de":"Kennst du den Herrn dort?","en":"Do you know the gentleman over there?","bn":"তুমি কি ওখানকার ভদ্রলোককে চেনো?"}]}]}],"part":1,"test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-n-deklination-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich sehe den ___. (der Student)","options":["Student","Studenten","Students"],"answer":1,"explanation":"N-declension: Akkusativ-এ -en: den Studenten।"},{"id"